@startuml Lihat_Status_Pesanan
!theme plain
title Sequence Diagram: Lihat Status Pesanan (View Order Status)
actor Customer
participant "Mobile App\n(Flutter)" as App
participant "Backend\nAPI" as API
database "Database" as DB

Customer -> App: Klik Menu Pesanan / Order History
App -> API: GET /api/orders?customer_id={id}
API -> DB: Query Order List (Customer)
DB --> API: Return Order List
API --> App: Response JSON (Order List)
App -> App: Parse & Display Orders
App --> Customer: Tampilkan Daftar Pesanan\n(Order ID, Tanggal, Status, Total)

Customer -> App: Klik Detail Pesanan
App -> API: GET /api/orders/{order_id}
API -> DB: Query Detail Order
DB --> API: Return Order Detail
API --> App: Response Order Detail

alt Order Dengan Tracking
    App -> API: GET /api/orders/{order_id}/tracking
    API -> DB: Query Order Tracking Status
    DB --> API: Return Tracking Data
    API --> App: Response (Status Timeline, Kurir Info)
    App --> Customer: Tampilkan Order Details\n(Items, Status, Timeline, Kurir Contact)
else Order COD/Menunggu
    App --> Customer: Tampilkan Status\n(Menunggu Konfirmasi Kurir)
end

alt Order Selesai
    Customer -> App: View Invoice/Receipt
    App --> Customer: Download/Share Receipt PDF
end

@enduml